v 3
d 'DASH': Interactive HTML dashboards from twoway syntax
d
d dash converts Stata twoway plot syntax into standalone interactive
d HTML dashboards powered by the Bokeh visualization library.
d Features include: multi-graph layouts, linked brushing, filter
d widgets (dropdown/slider/range), KPI cards, and full twoway
d option compatibility for scatter, line, area, bar, spike, lfit,
d qfit, lowess, histogram, kdensity, and range plots.
d
d All output is a self-contained HTML file that runs offline in
d any modern browser without a server or internet connection.
d
d Requires: Python 3.8+, bokeh>=3.0, numpy>=1.23, pandas>=1.5,
d           jsonio (SSC).
d Optional: scipy>=1.9 (lfitci, qfitci, kdensity, mspline) and
d           statsmodels>=0.13 (lowess).  Without them those layers
d           render empty with a warning; everything else works.
d
d Run -dash_setup- once after installation to install all dependencies.
d
d Version: 2.0  27mar2026
d Distribution-Date: 20260327
d
f dash.ado
f dash.sthlp
f dash_setup.ado
f dash_setup.sthlp
